{%- comment -%}
  Branded empty-state artwork: a navy-to-black gradient panel with the
  Emporeon trident mark centered. Used everywhere a product photo,
  collection image or lifestyle photo hasn't been uploaded yet, instead
  of Shopify's generic gray placeholder graphic — so unfinished sections
  still look intentional rather than empty.
  Must be placed inside a `position: relative` (or similar) container
  that clips overflow, since this fills it with `position: absolute`.
  Accepts: id (string, unique per instance on the page)
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="placeholder-art">
  {%- render 'icon-trident', class: 'placeholder-art__icon', id: id -%}
</div>
